  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Democracy in Latin America and the Caribbean (LAC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity helps citizens defend their rights against government abuses in several countries of Latin America and the Caribbean. The activity supports activists from Guatemala, Nicaragua, Venezuela and Cuba in documenting and presenting evidence of their governments abuses to international organizations</narrative>
  </description>
